  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\n“Decopins 2” is a sequel to “Decopins” a Decopin-type tower defense game.<p></p>\n<p>Use traditional Japanese finger flick -Decopins- to repel the approaching donuts and prevent them from escaping.</p>\n<p>This time, the cafe has been renovated, and in addition to the donuts, hamburgers also try to escape.</p>\n<p>Use decopin and magic to prevent the bastards from breaking defense lines.</p>\n<p>This time, It will be tougher…</p>\n<p>Collect EXP and money to level up your Decopins. Depending on your level, you will also be able to use magic.</p>\n<p>We would like to thank everyone who played the Decopins series, everyone who created wonderful music and sound effects, everyone who created 3D assets, and UE4.</p>\n<p><b>Game Features</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li>You can enjoy simple operations, mainly using the mouse and keyboard.\n</li><li>Implemented settings for adjusting the volume of BGM and SE.\n</li><li>you can use charge attacks.\n</li><li>It also has a snipe mode to decopin donuts in the distance.\n</li><li>We have 1-min Decopins challenge(available after clearing Stage 7).\n</li><li>Please handle your mouse with care.\n</li><li>Please refrain from using Decopin and magic in the real world.\n</li><li>You can enjoy Decopins2 even if you haven’t played Decopins1.\n</li></ul>\n",
